  "notes": "Indicates high probability. More formal and literary than たぶん.\n\nCOMPARISON WITH SIMILAR WORDS:\n・きっと - surely, definitely (high certainty)\n・おそらく - probably (formal, high probability)\n・たぶん - probably (casual, moderate probability)\n・もしかしたら - perhaps, maybe (lower probability)\n\nCan be written with kanji as {恐|おそ}らく.",
